# VOICE CONFIGURATION REFERENCE
# ============================================================================

# Popular ElevenLabs voices:
# Rachel (Female, English):     21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM
# Adam (Male, English):         pNInz6obpgDQGcFmaJgB  
# Bella (Female, English):      EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL
# Antoni (Male, English):       ErXwobaYiN019PkySvjV
# Elli (Female, English):       MF3mGyEYCl7XYWbV9V6O
# Josh (Male, English):         TxGEqnHWrfWFTfGW9XjX
# Arnold (Male, English):       VR6AewLTigWG4xSOukaG
# Sam (Male, English):          yoZ06aMxZJJ28mfd3POQ

# Models available:
# eleven_monolingual_v1         - High quality, English only
# eleven_multilingual_v1        - Good quality, multiple languages  
# eleven_multilingual_v2        - Best quality, multiple languages
# eleven_turbo_v2               - Fast generation, good quality
# eleven_turbo_v2_5             - Fastest generation
# eleven_flash_v2_5             - Optimized for real-time streaming

# Output formats:
# mp3_22050_32                  - Default, good quality
# mp3_44100_64                  - Higher quality
# mp3_44100_128                 - High quality
# mp3_44100_192                 - Very high quality
# pcm_16000                     - Raw PCM, 16kHz
# pcm_22050                     - Raw PCM, 22kHz
# pcm_24000                     - Raw PCM, 24kHz
# pcm_44100                     - Raw PCM, 44kHz

# Language codes (for multilingual models):
# en - English       es - Spanish       fr - French
# de - German        it - Italian       pt - Portuguese  
# hi - Hindi         ar - Arabic        zh - Chinese
# ja - Japanese      ko - Korean        pl - Polish
